  "drawerTour": "App guide",
  "drawerTourDesc": "Step by step: where everything is",
  "tourSkip": "Skip",
  "tourBack": "Back",
  "tourNext": "Next",
  "tourFinish": "Let's start",
  "tourWelcomeTitle": "Welcome! Let's take a tour",
  "tourWelcomeBody": "In a few steps you'll see where everything is: your daily plan, prayers, novenas, the rosary and the examination of conscience. Tap Next (or anywhere on the screen) to continue.",
  "tourNavGardenTitle": "Garden: your page for the day",
  "tourNavGardenBody": "This button on the bottom bar always brings you back here. This is where your daily prayer plan lives.",
  "tourGardenTitle": "Garden of the Soul",
  "tourGardenBody": "Each square is a day. It grows greener as you pray, and turns fully green on days of Mass or Confession. It shows your faithfulness over time.",
  "tourTodayTitle": "Today",
  "tourTodayBody": "Here are the prayers of your plan for today, grouped by morning, noon and night. Tap the box next to a prayer to mark it as prayed. Tap its name to open it, and the three-dot button on the right to change its time, set a reminder or remove it.",
  "tourAddTitle": "Add to your plan",
  "tourAddBody": "Use the + button to add a prayer, a novena or the rosary to your plan. Choose the time of day and, if you like, a reminder.",
  "tourCalendarTitle": "Calendar",
  "tourCalendarBody": "See what you prayed each day, your Masses, confessions and novenas, plus the liturgical season. Tap a day to see the details.",
  "tourRemindersTitle": "Reminders",
  "tourRemindersBody": "All of the app's reminders in one place: prayers, novenas, confession and the Church's days of obligation. You can pause, edit or create your own.",
  "tourMenuTitle": "Menu",
  "tourMenuBody": "Here you will find About the Project, this App guide (to watch again anytime) and Settings, such as language, text size and backup.",
  "tourPrayersTitle": "Prayers",
  "tourPrayersBody": "All the prayers in the app, organized by category. At the top you will find the prayer for this time of day and the saint of the day.",
  "tourSearchTitle": "Search for a prayer",
  "tourSearchBody": "Type part of the name or text. Search ignores accents and even forgives small typos.",
  "tourGuidesTitle": "Guides and devotions",
  "tourGuidesBody": "Guide to the Mass (traditional or current), a guide for Eucharistic Adoration and your prayer intentions.",
  "tourNovenasTitle": "Novenas",
  "tourNovenasBody": "A novena is a prayer said over nine days in a row. Here are the traditional novenas, such as the Christmas novena, the Sacred Heart and Immaculate Conception novenas, and those of saints like Saint Joseph. You follow each day without losing count.",
  "tourRosaryTitle": "Holy Rosary",
  "tourRosaryBody": "The guided Rosary: the app shows each prayer at the right moment, so you can pray without losing your place on the beads. It works anywhere, with no internet.",
  "tourExamTitle": "Examination of conscience",
  "tourExamBody": "The heart of the app for confession. Examine your conscience calmly, mark what you remember and take a summary to the confessional. Everything stays on your phone and can be password protected.",
  "tourEndTitle": "All set!",
  "tourEndBody": "You can watch this guide again anytime from the menu (the three lines at the top corner) › App guide. May this app help you pray every day. God bless you!",
  "onbFeatureRosary": "The Holy Rosary bead by bead, and novenas with a daily reminder",
  "onbFeatureGuides": "Guides for Mass and Adoration, plus your prayer intentions",
  "onbPrivacyTitle": "Your prayer is yours alone",
  "onbPrivacyBody": "Everything you record is stored only on this phone.",
  "onbPrivacyNoAccount": "No account, no login",
  "onbPrivacyNoAds": "No ads, no tracking",
  "onbPrivacyBackup": "You make the backup, whenever you want",
  "onbProjectTitle": "Free, made with love",
  "onbProjectBody": "Sancta is free and has no ads. It was made by Thalita and Diego, a couple preparing for marriage. Praying for us is already a great gift; if you'd like to help, see About the Project in the menu.",
  "onbProjectBodyStore": "Sancta is free and has no ads. It was made by Thalita and Diego, a couple preparing for marriage. If you can, please pray for us!",
  "onbReadyTitle": "All set!",
  "onbReadyBody": "Would you like a quick tour of the screen? The guide shows where everything is. You can see it again anytime in Menu › App guide.",
  "onbTourStart": "Show me the guide",
  "onbTourSkip": "Start without the guide",
  "gardenDemoHint": "Example: this is how the garden looks after a year of prayer and perseverance. Yours starts today!",
  "afterTourTitle": "About this app",
  "afterTourBody": "Sancta was created by Thalita and Diego to help pay for our wedding expenses, but also so that Catholics can pray well and live their faith every day. It is free and has no ads. If it helps you and you'd like to contribute, tap the button below; and a prayer for us is already a great gift.",
  "afterTourBodyStore": "Sancta was created by Thalita and Diego so that Catholics can pray well and live their faith every day, and also to help with our wedding expenses. It is free and has no ads. A prayer for us is already a great gift.",
  "afterTourButton": "Learn about the project",
  "afterTourLater": "Not now",
  "tourNovenaSearchTitle": "Find your novena",
  "tourNovenaSearchBody": "Type the name of the saint or devotion. Search forgives typos and accents. When a feast is coming up, the app suggests the right novena at the top of the list.",
  "tourNovenaStartTitle": "Start and follow",
  "tourNovenaStartBody": "Tap a novena to read the prayer for each day. In Start Novena you choose the first day and the reminder time. From then on the day's prayer appears in the Today tab, your progress is saved and a candle lights in your Garden.",
  "tourRosaryProgressTitle": "Your Rosary today",
  "tourRosaryProgressBody": "Each circle is a Rosary prayed today. Four (with the luminous mysteries) or three (in Traditional Mode, which you choose in Settings) make a full Rosary, and the app celebrates when you get there.",
  "tourRosaryTodayTitle": "Mysteries of the day",
  "tourRosaryTodayBody": "The app already picks the mysteries for the day of the week. Tap the card to pray: the prayers advance bead by bead with Next and Previous. The screen stays on, the phone vibrates on each Hail Mary, longer after the 10th Hail Mary, and when you finish there is a shower of petals and a rose in your Garden.",
  "tourExamHeaderTitle": "Your confessions",
  "tourExamHeaderBody": "Here you record your last confession and plan the next one. The app reminds you when it is coming up and shows how long it has been.",
  "tourExamJornadaTitle": "Confession Journey",
  "tourExamJornadaBody": "A step-by-step path to prepare well: prayer, examination, contrition and resolution, until the day you go to confession. Great for anyone returning to confession after a long time.",
  "tourExamSectionsTitle": "Examine by category",
  "tourExamSectionsBody": "Go through the categories, such as the Commandments and the capital sins, and tap + on each item you remember (tap again if it happened more than once). Use search to find a sin by name.",
  "tourExamGuideTitle": "Generate the guide",
  "tourExamGuideBody": "When you finish, tap Generate guide: the app builds an organized summary of what you marked, to take to confession. When you confirm the confession, the marks are cleared and your Garden gets a lily.",
  "backupRestoring": "Restoring your backup… This may take a few seconds."
}
